# No deployer-owned game-AI provider secrets are required.
# Game AI is optional. When a host adds an AI player, that host supplies 1-8 API Keys in the browser.
# The game-AI keys are used transiently for the requested AI turn and are not stored in Durable Object state.
#
# Trilingual live translation uses Google Cloud Translation Basic v2.
# For local development only, copy this file to .dev.vars and set real keys there (never commit .dev.vars):
# GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_API_KEYS=google-key-1,google-key-2
# Production should use: npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_API_KEYS
